WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.033 --> 00:00:04.503
- Here to look at these kittens.

00:00:04.503 --> 00:00:05.540
But am I nervous?

00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:06.690
Yeah, I'm fucking nervous.

00:00:07.270 --> 00:00:08.477
- Like if a cat was big enough

00:00:08.477 --> 00:00:10.196
it absolutely would eat you.

00:00:10.196 --> 00:00:12.274
- I'm beyond excited to meet a kitten.

00:00:12.774 --> 00:00:14.766
- Uh, they don't bother
me, I don't bother them.

00:00:14.766 --> 00:00:15.894
- Don't like cats.

00:00:15.894 --> 00:00:17.451
- I might be allergic to cats.

00:00:17.451 --> 00:00:19.515
I know that I'm allergic to cats.

00:00:19.515 --> 00:00:22.571
- So, I'm gonna go visit the incubator

00:00:22.571 --> 00:00:24.150
where the cats are hatched.

00:00:24.150 --> 00:00:25.392
- Here we go.

00:00:27.762 --> 00:00:29.238
It's so little.

00:00:29.238 --> 00:00:30.025
- You want me to take two?

00:00:30.025 --> 00:00:30.953
Two or one?

00:00:40.993 --> 00:00:41.802
- Oh my.

00:00:44.048 --> 00:00:45.342
- They're doing it.

00:00:45.626 --> 00:00:47.806
- There are three small children cats.

00:00:49.026 --> 00:00:50.300
Child cats.

00:00:53.380 --> 00:00:55.134
- Ah, I like this one.

00:00:55.764 --> 00:00:58.280
- You got anymore of
these little loves of joy?

00:01:03.790 --> 00:01:05.113
- Do you need my help?

00:01:09.513 --> 00:01:11.560
I'm feeling...

00:01:14.300 --> 00:01:16.233
Feelings of...

00:01:17.225 --> 00:01:20.313
What I can only describe
as maternal protection.

00:01:22.763 --> 00:01:25.042
- Reminds me of Stalone in Cliffhanger.

00:01:37.002 --> 00:01:38.685
- I feel like a mommy.

00:01:38.685 --> 00:01:41.133
I take back all the really
mean things I said about cats.

00:01:43.973 --> 00:01:45.700
- Am I a changed man?

00:01:45.700 --> 00:01:46.542
Yes.

00:01:46.962 --> 00:01:48.724
- It could have been worse I imagine.

00:01:48.724 --> 00:01:51.221
I was a little skeptical at first.

00:01:52.031 --> 00:01:53.102
Well uh...

00:01:55.922 --> 00:01:56.922
You want to get down?

00:01:58.252 --> 00:02:00.264
- This is, it's pretty adorable.

00:02:00.264 --> 00:02:03.253
I don't know, I mean, I can see myself

00:02:03.253 --> 00:02:05.229
getting a little kitten like this.

00:02:05.229 --> 00:02:06.072
They're pretty cute.

00:02:06.772 --> 00:02:08.174
- I felt something.

00:02:09.874 --> 00:02:13.537
- Uh, this has been a mind
changing experience for me.

00:02:14.757 --> 00:02:16.694
I really have changed my mind about cats

00:02:16.694 --> 00:02:18.134
and you should adopt one.

00:02:19.294 --> 00:02:20.474
- I'll be fine.

00:02:20.474 --> 00:02:22.661
- I feel like if you like raise them

00:02:22.661 --> 00:02:24.890
and they'll just love you forever.

00:02:25.320 --> 00:02:27.121
Look at this little guy.

00:02:27.121 --> 00:02:27.908
He's just...

00:02:29.918 --> 00:02:31.963
- This is the tool for the job.

00:02:32.763 --> 00:02:34.529
You must learn to hunt little ones.

00:02:35.559 --> 00:02:37.832
If you're ever to survive on your own.

00:02:44.151 --> 00:02:44.746
Oh!

